        {
          "question": "e-413",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "Factoring the constant out of the integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{2}9{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x & =9{\\int }_{-1}^{2}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =9\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}\\,{|}_{-1}^{2} \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}\\,{|}_{-1}^{2} \\\\  & =3({2}^{3}-(-1)^{3}) \\\\  & =3(8-(-1)) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 9 \\\\  & =27.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
